.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ckman-openpgp-keys-set-touch 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-openpgp\-keys\-set\-touch \- Set the touch policy for a key slot
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-openpgp\-keys\-set\-touch\fR [\fB\-a\fR|\fB\-\-admin\-pin\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIKEY\fR> <\fIPOLICY\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set the touch policy for a key slot
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-a\fR, \fB\-\-admin\-pin\fR \fI<ADMIN_PIN>\fR
Admin PIN (prompted when omitted)
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Do not ask for confirmation
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIKEY\fR>
Key slot
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
sig
.IP \(bu 2
dec
.IP \(bu 2
aut
.RE
.TP
<\fIPOLICY\fR>
Touch policy to set
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
off
.IP \(bu 2
on
.IP \(bu 2
fixed
.IP \(bu 2
cached
.IP \(bu 2
cached\-fixed
.RE
